# Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# The Firebase project config is NOT here any more. The native SDK
# (@react-native-firebase) reads it from google-services.json on Android and
# GoogleService-Info.plist on iOS, which is why those files — not env vars —
# are what a build needs. See README.md for where to download them.

# Directory (tenant) ID of your Microsoft Entra ID tenant, from the Azure
# portal: Entra ID -> Overview -> Directory (tenant) ID.
#
# Setting it restricts "Continue with Microsoft" to accounts in your
# institution's tenant. Leaving it blank falls back to 'common', which lets
# ANY Microsoft account reach the sign-in step — they are still rejected
# afterwards by the institutional-email check, but the tenant restriction is
# the cleaner gate and gives the user a better error.
EXPO_PUBLIC_AZURE_TENANT_ID=
